TYPE	news
DATE	2026-11-10
TITLE	Oil slide fuels stock rebound ahead of US inflation test	น้ำมันร่วงหนุนหุ้นฟื้นตัว ก่อนบททดสอบเงินเฟ้อสหรัฐฯ
NOTE	US closes for Monday 9 Nov. SET and baht as of Monday. Iron ore is the Dalian January contract. Crypto as of Monday evening US time.
M	S&P 500	7,549.94	+2.35%	
M	Nasdaq	25,253.14	+2.74%	
M	SET	1,473.07	+0.50%	
M	USD/THB	33.42	−0.43%	Baht firmer
M	Gold	$4,138.65/oz	+0.11%	Spot
M	Brent	$92.57/bbl	−5.9%	Lowest since August
M	US 10Y	4.864%	+0.1%	Little changed
M	Iron ore	¥687.5/t	−0.29%	Dalian I2701
M	Bitcoin	$74,824	+0.14%	24h
